From cb9b60e9e19610c39376baeb4f3ca314ca1e1907 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexandre Frade <kernel@xanmod.org>
Date: Mon, 18 Nov 2024 22:23:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] XANMOD: Makefile: Move ARM and x86 instruction set
 selection to kernel-wide build

Signed-off-by: Alexandre Frade <kernel@xanmod.org>
---
