 arch/arm/Makefile        |  56 +----------
 arch/x86/Makefile        |  96 -------------------
 arch/x86/Makefile_32.cpu |  41 --------
 scripts/Makefile.uarches | 202 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 206 insertions(+), 190 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 scripts/Makefile.uarches

